{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "5c16bd31-8117-53b8-9bbf-7c090710159f",
    "name": "FinUp Backend",
    "description": "Collection do finup-backend (Users, Categories, Payment Methods, Transactions, FinUp Score, Conversations e Assistente de IA).\n\nAutenticacao: sem `accessToken`, usa os headers X-Mock-Cognito-* (rode a API com SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE=dev,mock-auth). Com `accessToken` preenchido (token do Cognito), envia Authorization: Bearer.\n\nOrdem sugerida: rodar as pastas de cima para baixo (Collection Runner). Os ids (userId, categoryId, transactionId, paymentMethodId) sao capturados automaticamente.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Identidade de cada request:",
          "//  - com accessToken preenchido -> Authorization: Bearer (Cognito real)",
          "//  - sem accessToken            -> headers X-Mock-Cognito-* (profile mock-auth)",
          "const token = pm.collectionVariables.get('accessToken');",
          "if (token) {",
          "  pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'Authorization', value: 'Bearer ' + token });",
          "} else {",
          "  pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-Mock-Cognito-Sub', value: pm.collectionVariables.get('mockSub') });",
          "  pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-Mock-Cognito-Email', value: pm.collectionVariables.get('mockEmail') });",
          "  pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-Mock-Cognito-Name', value: pm.collectionVariables.get('mockName') });",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    },
    {
      "key": "mockSub",
      "value": "mock-sub-postman",
      "description": "Identidade mock (profile mock-auth)"
    },
    {
      "key": "mockEmail",
      "value": "postman@finup.local"
    },
    {
      "key": "mockName",
      "value": "Usuario Postman"
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": "",
      "description": "Token do Cognito. Vazio = usa os headers mock."
    },
    {
      "key": "userId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
